<img src="2402.00789v1/images/icon_2.jpeg" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:40/40;" width="40" height="40" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span></span></span>
</span>
</span>
Graph-Mamba: Towards Long-Range Graph Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chloe Wang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
