<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Additional Benchmark Results.</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix B Additional Benchmark Results. ‣ Graph-Mamba: Towards Long-Range Graph Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> presents benchmark results on the five datasets with small to medium input length, ranging from 30 to 120 nodes in the graph. Graph-Mamba demonstrates predictive performance comparable to GraphGPS with full Transformer and Exphormer, endorsing its generalizability to common graph tasks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="A2.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Benchmark on Short to Medium-Range Graph Datasets</span> with existing methods. Best results are colored in <span id="A2.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00E000;">first</span>, <span id="A2.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF7D00;">second</span>, <span id="A2.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#6E73FF;">third</span>.</figcaption>
